","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and July to August and October to November each came in under 90% of normal in 34 of those 75 years. In 2025, August to September on the middle came in at 68% of normal and July to August at 79%. So far in 2026, March to April on the middle came in at 161% of normal and May to June at 82%.</p>"}
